{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "v1.6.0.4", "body": [{"from": 0.04, "to": 0.46, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "大家好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 0.46, "to": 1.09, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "我是杨", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 1.09, "to": 4.54, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "在B站这几个月学习瞄准相关知识的时候呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 4.54, "to": 6.64, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "我发现很多IP的新手玩家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 6.64, "to": 8.62, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "对瞄准还没有一个正确的认识", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 8.62, "to": 10.9, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "我今天呢就准备出一期视频", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 10.9, "to": 13.24, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "把我这几个月学到的瞄准有关的知识", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 13.24, "to": 14.17, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "分享给大家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 14.17, "to": 17.25, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "让大家明白什么是正确的瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.25, "to": 18.45, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "首先介绍一下我自己", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 18.45, "to": 20.679, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "我的瓦兰特段位是超凡六", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 20.679, "to": 21.759, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "目标是13万分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 21.759, "to": 24.099, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "我的段位其实并不是什么超级高手", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 24.099, "to": 25.959, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "因为我打游戏的话不喜欢动脑子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.959, "to": 26.979, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "只喜欢对枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 26.979, "to": 29.53, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "所以段位并不是很高", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 29.53, "to": 32.56, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "但是我认为我对瞄准还是有一个清晰的认知的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 32.56, "to": 35.74, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "那么我下面就跟大家说一下瞄准究竟是什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 35.74, "to": 37.92, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "如果用一句话来概括瞄准的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.92, "to": 41.42, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "我觉得是把准星快速自然的放到目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 41.42, "to": 42.98, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "这听起来是一句废话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.98, "to": 44.57, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "但它其实有两个重点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 44.57, "to": 47.15, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "第一个就是把准星放到目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.15, "to": 49.41, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "那么什么是目标呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.41, "to": 52.14, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "大家肯定会觉得是敌人对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 52.14, "to": 53.43, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "但是如果准确的说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.43, "to": 55.32, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "目标其实是我们眼睛看的地方", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 55.32, "to": 58.72, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "在我们平时游玩中走路的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 58.72, "to": 61.24, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "我们的眼睛肯定是聚焦在准星附近", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 61.24, "to": 63.91, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "而如果在我们走的过程中突然出现一个敌人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 63.91, "to": 65.68, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "这时候就需要我们眼睛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 65.68, "to": 70.07, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "快速的从准星附近的区域转移到这个目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 70.07, "to": 72.83, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "当我们转移的是目标的角的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 72.83, "to": 74.82, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "我们就会把准星打到角", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 74.82, "to": 76.32, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "如果我们转移到头的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 76.32, "to": 77.22, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "我们就会打他头", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.22, "to": 78.289, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "对他进行秒杀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 78.289, "to": 80.749, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "如果我们只是大概模糊的看清楚", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 80.749, "to": 82.069, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "这有一块东西的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 82.069, "to": 84.949, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "那我们的子弹就大概率是打到这一块东西上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 84.949, "to": 86.77, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "并不能进行精准的秒杀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 86.77, "to": 89.57, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "所以眼睛在瞄准的一开始", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 89.57, "to": 91.22, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "是起到至关重要的作用的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 91.22, "to": 94.07, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "而眼睛的能力就是注意力从准星附近", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 94.07, "to": 96.509, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "快速且清晰的转移到目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 96.509, "to": 97.889, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "这虽然听起来很容易", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 97.889, "to": 100.409, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "但是在实际的过程中其实并没有那么容易", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 100.409, "to": 104.53, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "尤其是在远距离这种摆设的过程中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.53, "to": 106.54, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "因为远距离他的头本来就小", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 106.54, "to": 108.13, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "且它在ADAE的移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 108.13, "to": 110.85, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "这其实并没有那么容易看清楚", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 110.85, "to": 112.44, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "所以练枪不能只练手", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 112.44, "to": 113.34, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "还要练眼", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 113.34, "to": 114.3, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "如果想练的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 114.3, "to": 116.34, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "可以去打m lab的green shot", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 116.34, "to": 118.63, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "或者看note的那个动图", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 118.63, "to": 122.729, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "但是呢因为我们在生活中都会使用眼嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 122.729, "to": 125.579, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "所以眼睛其实是经过训练的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 125.579, "to": 127.349, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "而对于新手玩家来说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.349, "to": 128.879, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "手部的控制能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 128.879, "to": 131.19, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "才是应该一开始中之重去训练的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 131.19, "to": 133.23, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "而说到手部的控制能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 133.23, "to": 135.54, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "那就需要说到瞄准的第二步", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 135.54, "to": 137.01, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "也就是我刚刚说的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 137.01, "to": 139.959, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "把准星自然快速的放到目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 139.959, "to": 143.079, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "那么怎么理解自然快速的放到目标上呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 143.079, "to": 146.709, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "我觉得一个合理的发力方式其实是非常重要的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 146.709, "to": 148.66, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "也是我这期视频的重点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 148.66, "to": 151.84, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "在传统意义的对于设计的理解来说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 151.84, "to": 154.68, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "大家趋向于用手臂进行大范围的移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 154.68, "to": 156.75, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "用手腕进行小范围的微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 156.75, "to": 160.699, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "但其实这是一种比较教条且不自然的瞄准方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 160.699, "to": 162.559, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "就像用圆规画一个圆一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 162.559, "to": 165.12, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "我们用圆规虽然可以稳定地画出一个圆", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 165.12, "to": 167.13, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "但是并不能画出一个正方形", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 167.13, "to": 168.06, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "而在实战中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 168.06, "to": 169.44, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "我们需要打的是360度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 169.44, "to": 170.57, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "任何角度的敌人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 170.57, "to": 172.43, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "尤其是在瓦兰特这款游戏中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 172.43, "to": 173.72, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "对面有会飞的杰特", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 173.72, "to": 175.58, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "有跳过来的raise", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 175.58, "to": 178.59, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "所以我们不能局限于以某个地方为轴", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 178.59, "to": 179.85, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "就像圆规一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 179.85, "to": 180.45, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "只能画圆", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 180.45, "to": 182.61, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "我们应该去进行360度射击", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 182.61, "to": 185.01, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "瞄准这些敌人以某个地方为轴的特点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 185.01, "to": 188.68, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "就是它可以稳定的做出某些动作", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 188.68, "to": 191.59, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "比如说不同高度的爆头线转换", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 191.59, "to": 195.04, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "我就会以手臂与桌子的接触点为轴进行转换", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 195.04, "to": 197.11, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "但是当我进行定位射击的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 197.11, "to": 198.64, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "我并不会把这作为轴", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 198.64, "to": 200.41, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "我会自然地动我整个手", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 200.41, "to": 202.88, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "让他带动我的胳膊去进行瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 202.88, "to": 204.98, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "这么说大家可能觉得比较抽象", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 204.98, "to": 207.05, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "那大家现在可以想一个动作", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 207.05, "to": 208.99, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "就是我们跟人挥手告别", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 208.99, "to": 210.89, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "当我们跟着挥手告别的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 210.89, "to": 212.9, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "是不是我们只是在挥我们的手", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 212.9, "to": 215.15, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "然后我们的小臂大臂", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 215.15, "to": 218.12, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "肩膀等肌肉和关节就自然的被带动了起来呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 218.12, "to": 218.93, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "大家试想一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 218.93, "to": 221.5, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "如果我们这时候把鼠标握在手上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 221.5, "to": 222.43, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "跟着挥手告别", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 222.43, "to": 223.9, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "那是一种什么感觉呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 223.9, "to": 227.04, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "如果大家能理解我说的这种发力的感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 227.04, "to": 229.5, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "那么你就学会了自然的瞄准方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 229.5, "to": 232.73, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "那自然的瞄准方式相比于传统意义上来说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 232.73, "to": 233.57, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "手臂拉枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 233.57, "to": 235.58, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "手腕微调它有什么好处呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 235.58, "to": 239.4, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "首先我认为没有轴的瞄准可以更加自然", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 239.4, "to": 240.84, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "敌人从任何角度过来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 240.84, "to": 243.27, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "我们都可以舒服的打它", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 243.27, "to": 247.109, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "比如说如果以传统意义的发力方式进行瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 247.109, "to": 249.62, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "我是没法很自然地画一个S的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 249.62, "to": 252.14, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "因为我手腕以某个地方为轴", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 252.14, "to": 254.27, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "我只能像圆规一样画这种半圆", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 254.27, "to": 257.37, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "我并不能大幅度的做出这种S的动作", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 257.37, "to": 259.98, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "所以它的瞄准是相对死板教条的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 259.98, "to": 261.559, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "会让你的肌肉很紧绷", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 261.559, "to": 263.749, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "而如果你的肌肉紧绷的情况下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 263.749, "to": 267.019, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "你去打目标的切换其实就很费劲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 267.019, "to": 269.17, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "就比如说当我们打第一枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 269.17, "to": 270.04, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "打第一枪的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 270.04, "to": 270.82, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "这个人动了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 270.82, "to": 272.58, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "我们需要快速的调整第二枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 272.58, "to": 273.9, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "如果是传统意义上来讲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 273.9, "to": 277.17, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "我们要主动的掰我们的手腕或者动我们的手臂", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 277.17, "to": 278.67, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "他会让我们的肌肉很紧绷", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 278.67, "to": 280.62, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "但我们进行第二项射击的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 280.62, "to": 282.12, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "我们的枪法就会变形", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 282.12, "to": 284.37, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "而如果我们使用自然的发力方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 284.37, "to": 285.78, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "无论这个人怎么扭动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 285.78, "to": 288.94, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "我们始终是用手带动整个胳膊去进行瞄准的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 288.94, "to": 290.26, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "他是很放松的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 290.26, "to": 291.64, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "所以无论这个人怎么扭", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 291.64, "to": 293.72, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "我们都可以舒服的调整第二枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 293.72, "to": 296.42, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "这我认为是自然瞄准第一个好处", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 296.42, "to": 300.14, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "而第二个好处我觉得就是可以有效的预防伤病", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 300.14, "to": 302.72, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "因为传统意义上来说的手臂拉枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 302.72, "to": 303.68, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "手腕微调的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 303.68, "to": 308.44, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "我们需要主动的发力来使用手臂或者手腕", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 308.44, "to": 311.56, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "而主动且大力量的扭动我们的手腕", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 311.56, "to": 313.48, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "会给我们手腕造成很大的损伤", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 313.48, "to": 314.2, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "时间长了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 314.2, "to": 315.46, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "手腕必然会疼", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 315.46, "to": 317.38, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "而使用第二种发力方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 317.38, "to": 320.83, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "我们只需要自然的把手放到目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 320.83, "to": 325.07, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "我们的手腕小臂大臂肩膀会自然的跟随过来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 325.07, "to": 326.9, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "就像挥手告别这个动作一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 326.9, "to": 328.97, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "整个动作说是自然流畅的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 328.97, "to": 330.83, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "我们的身体是被使用的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 330.83, "to": 332.84, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "就像大家可以想象走路一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 332.84, "to": 333.77, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "我们走路的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 333.77, "to": 335.3, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "是不是我们往前走", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 335.3, "to": 339.1, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "我们的大腿小腿脚自然的在移动呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 339.1, "to": 341.14, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "如果我们反过来想", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 341.14, "to": 342.64, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "我们应该怎么样走路", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 342.64, "to": 344.38, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "是先迈左腿还是先迈右腿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 344.38, "to": 345.16, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "是大腿发力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 345.16, "to": 345.88, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "小腿发力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 345.88, "to": 348.01, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "那么我们是不是就不会走路呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 348.01, "to": 350.59, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "所以我认为瞄准和这个道理是一样的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 350.59, "to": 352.9, "sid": 163, "location": 2, "content": "整个动作应该是自然且连贯的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 352.9, "to": 356.34, "sid": 164, "location": 2, "content": "这不仅能解放我们的瞄准范围", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 356.34, "to": 357.45, "sid": 165, "location": 2, "content": "还能减少伤病", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 357.45, "to": 359.94, "sid": 166, "location": 2, "content": "是我认为非常重要的一个事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 359.94, "to": 361.74, "sid": 167, "location": 2, "content": "也是我这期视频的重点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 361.74, "to": 365.17, "sid": 168, "location": 2, "content": "大家一定要去理解我说的这种发力方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 365.17, "to": 367.21, "sid": 169, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢说完了定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 367.21, "to": 368.55, "sid": 170, "location": 2, "content": "我再来说一下微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 368.55, "to": 369.57, "sid": 171, "location": 2, "content": "刚刚我也说了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 369.57, "to": 371.85, "sid": 172, "location": 2, "content": "是用手去带动整个鼠标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 371.85, "to": 373.61, "sid": 173, "location": 2, "content": "那么我们的手有什么呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 373.61, "to": 374.99, "sid": 174, "location": 2, "content": "我们的手是由手掌", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 374.99, "to": 376.28, "sid": 175, "location": 2, "content": "手指手腕组成的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 376.28, "to": 378.37, "sid": 176, "location": 2, "content": "也就是说在瞄准的过程中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 378.37, "to": 380.56, "sid": 177, "location": 2, "content": "我们整个手都要参与瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 380.56, "to": 381.73, "sid": 178, "location": 2, "content": "尤其是手指", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 381.73, "to": 383.41, "sid": 179, "location": 2, "content": "我们在进行微调的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 383.41, "to": 385.72, "sid": 180, "location": 2, "content": "一定要用手指去进行微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 385.72, "to": 389.89, "sid": 181, "location": 2, "content": "感觉就是感觉他就是我用手指去指这个目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 389.89, "to": 391.57, "sid": 182, "location": 2, "content": "我不知道大家能不能理解这种感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 391.57, "to": 394.03, "sid": 183, "location": 2, "content": "就是我在用手指指向这个目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 394.03, "to": 396.63, "sid": 184, "location": 2, "content": "然后我的手因为我的手指在动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 396.63, "to": 399.77, "sid": 185, "location": 2, "content": "我的手自然地被我的手指带动了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 400.35, "to": 402.62, "sid": 186, "location": 2, "content": "然后我的手腕就被我的手带动了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 402.62, "to": 406.03, "sid": 187, "location": 2, "content": "然后我的小臂大臂肩膀跟随着我的手", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 406.03, "to": 407.23, "sid": 188, "location": 2, "content": "而自然的运动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 407.23, "to": 408.25, "sid": 189, "location": 2, "content": "大家可以感受一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 408.25, "to": 409.69, "sid": 190, "location": 2, "content": "这种瞄准是很舒服的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 409.69, "to": 410.84, "sid": 191, "location": 2, "content": "很自然的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 410.84, "to": 412.67, "sid": 192, "location": 2, "content": "它并不像传统意杀来说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 412.67, "to": 414.9, "sid": 193, "location": 2, "content": "我要先拉枪再微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 414.9, "to": 416.94, "sid": 194, "location": 2, "content": "这在这种发力方向瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 416.94, "to": 418.95, "sid": 195, "location": 2, "content": "其实就是直接的一次定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 418.95, "to": 422.07, "sid": 196, "location": 2, "content": "并并没有什么先拉前后微调之处", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 422.07, "to": 426.41, "sid": 197, "location": 2, "content": "因为是手带动整个小臂大臂肩膀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 426.41, "to": 428.24, "sid": 198, "location": 2, "content": "拉枪和微调是在一起进行的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 428.24, "to": 432.01, "sid": 199, "location": 2, "content": "所以给人的感觉看起来就会很舒服", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 436.78, "to": 440.16, "sid": 200, "location": 2, "content": "大家一定要去理解我这种我说的这种发育方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 440.16, "to": 442.32, "sid": 201, "location": 2, "content": "他真的对瞄准有很大的帮助", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 442.32, "to": 446.34, "sid": 202, "location": 2, "content": "然后说完了游戏内的身体中的这种发力方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 446.34, "to": 448.26, "sid": 203, "location": 2, "content": "我再说一下游戏外的一些事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 448.26, "to": 451.83, "sid": 204, "location": 2, "content": "比如说我认为无关紧要的一些就是灵敏度啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 451.83, "to": 452.58, "sid": 205, "location": 2, "content": "鼠标垫啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 452.58, "to": 453.33, "sid": 206, "location": 2, "content": "鼠标啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 453.33, "to": 454.56, "sid": 207, "location": 2, "content": "脚贴啊这些", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 454.56, "to": 456.87, "sid": 208, "location": 2, "content": "因为我觉得这些东西无论怎么换", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 456.87, "to": 459.09, "sid": 209, "location": 2, "content": "它只是对你瞄准的感觉有所不同", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 459.09, "to": 461.46, "sid": 210, "location": 2, "content": "并不会影响你瞄准的水平", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 461.46, "to": 463.51, "sid": 211, "location": 2, "content": "因为瞄准的本质是手眼协调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 463.51, "to": 465.28, "sid": 212, "location": 2, "content": "即眼睛看清楚目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 465.28, "to": 468.28, "sid": 213, "location": 2, "content": "然后移动手把准星自然的放在目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 468.28, "to": 470.629, "sid": 214, "location": 2, "content": "使用不同的鼠标垫", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 470.629, "to": 473.7, "sid": 215, "location": 2, "content": "鼠标脚贴只会改变你的一些感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 473.7, "to": 476.28, "sid": 216, "location": 2, "content": "比如说有的鼠标垫它的拉枪比较舒服", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 476.28, "to": 478.31, "sid": 217, "location": 2, "content": "有的鼠标垫它的微调比较舒服", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 478.31, "to": 481.37, "sid": 218, "location": 2, "content": "有的鼠标键它拉墙接接微调的衔接比较舒服", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 481.37, "to": 482.06, "sid": 219, "location": 2, "content": "仅此而已", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 482.06, "to": 483.75, "sid": 220, "location": 2, "content": "并不会影响你的瞄准水平", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 483.75, "to": 485.13, "sid": 221, "location": 2, "content": "握姿也是一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 485.13, "to": 486.48, "sid": 222, "location": 2, "content": "使用不同的握姿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 486.48, "to": 490.49, "sid": 223, "location": 2, "content": "只会让你的瞄准的发力的感觉舒服或者不舒服", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 490.49, "to": 493.309, "sid": 224, "location": 2, "content": "并不会影响你的发力方式或者怎么怎么样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 493.309, "to": 496.099, "sid": 225, "location": 2, "content": "所以大家不用过分的纠结于这些东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 496.099, "to": 498.229, "sid": 226, "location": 2, "content": "只需要买一些大厂能持续产出", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 498.229, "to": 501.71, "sid": 227, "location": 2, "content": "保证一个相对一段时间的手感一致性就可以了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 501.71, "to": 503.18, "sid": 228, "location": 2, "content": "而灵敏度其实也一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 503.18, "to": 504.71, "sid": 229, "location": 2, "content": "当我们使用高敏的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 504.71, "to": 508.05, "sid": 230, "location": 2, "content": "我们只是主要使用手腕和手指的肌肉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 508.05, "to": 509.16, "sid": 231, "location": 2, "content": "而像地面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 509.16, "to": 511.5, "sid": 232, "location": 2, "content": "像低门外那种800×0.2的低敏的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 511.5, "to": 514.41, "sid": 233, "location": 2, "content": "我们就会主要使用大臂和肩膀的肌肉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 514.41, "to": 517.32, "sid": 234, "location": 2, "content": "无论是哪种情况都不会影响到我们的瞄准能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 517.32, "to": 519.339, "sid": 235, "location": 2, "content": "所以大家不要在这些呃", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 519.339, "to": 521.349, "sid": 236, "location": 2, "content": "没有太大意义的事情上纠结", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 521.349, "to": 523.299, "sid": 237, "location": 2, "content": "只需要当前的这些东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 523.299, "to": 525.53, "sid": 238, "location": 2, "content": "你觉得用的舒服就可以了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 525.53, "to": 527.03, "sid": 239, "location": 2, "content": "而相比于这些不重要", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 527.03, "to": 528.59, "sid": 240, "location": 2, "content": "我觉得对于瞄准来说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 528.59, "to": 530.27, "sid": 241, "location": 2, "content": "最重要的其实是坐姿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 530.27, "to": 532.25, "sid": 242, "location": 2, "content": "因为我们只有坐的舒服了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 532.25, "to": 533.98, "sid": 243, "location": 2, "content": "我们身上的肌肉才放松", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 533.98, "to": 536.98, "sid": 244, "location": 2, "content": "我们进行瞄准的时候呢才能舒服", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 536.98, "to": 538.9, "sid": 245, "location": 2, "content": "那么我们现在就跟大家说一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 538.9, "to": 540.98, "sid": 246, "location": 2, "content": "怎么去找一个正确的桌椅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 540.98, "to": 542.03, "sid": 247, "location": 2, "content": "相对高度差", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 542.03, "to": 545.2, "sid": 248, "location": 2, "content": "首先呢我们应该把脚踩在地上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 545.2, "to": 547.69, "sid": 249, "location": 2, "content": "把屁股呢大面积的坐在椅子上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 547.69, "to": 550.39, "sid": 250, "location": 2, "content": "这样呢能把我们下半身的力均匀地分布", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 550.39, "to": 552.91, "sid": 251, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢大家现在把手放到大腿上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 552.91, "to": 554.41, "sid": 252, "location": 2, "content": "或者摸膝盖感受一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 554.41, "to": 556.82, "sid": 253, "location": 2, "content": "这时候整条胳膊包括肩膀啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 556.82, "to": 559.52, "sid": 254, "location": 2, "content": "脖子腋下这些地方的一个肌肉状态", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 559.52, "to": 560.42, "sid": 255, "location": 2, "content": "是不是很放松", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 560.42, "to": 561.08, "sid": 256, "location": 2, "content": "很舒服的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 561.08, "to": 564.74, "sid": 257, "location": 2, "content": "然后这时候我们抬起小臂和手平行于地面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 564.74, "to": 566.21, "sid": 258, "location": 2, "content": "再高一点点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 566.21, "to": 568.72, "sid": 259, "location": 2, "content": "这就是应该是一个合适的桌子高度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 568.72, "to": 571.5, "sid": 260, "location": 2, "content": "在这种桌椅相对高度差的情况下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 571.5, "to": 574.02, "sid": 261, "location": 2, "content": "我们进行瞄准的动作是自然的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 574.02, "to": 575.58, "sid": 262, "location": 2, "content": "我们的肌肉也是放松的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 575.58, "to": 577.05, "sid": 263, "location": 2, "content": "他对我们的瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 577.05, "to": 580.03, "sid": 264, "location": 2, "content": "还有我们的健康是很有帮助的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 580.03, "to": 581.23, "sid": 265, "location": 2, "content": "如果桌子高了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 581.23, "to": 583.72, "sid": 266, "location": 2, "content": "我们就要需要张开手臂", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 583.72, "to": 584.77, "sid": 267, "location": 2, "content": "甚至说是耸肩", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 584.77, "to": 587.01, "sid": 268, "location": 2, "content": "才能把我们的手臂放到桌子上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 587.01, "to": 589.2, "sid": 269, "location": 2, "content": "这样不仅对我们的肩膀有损伤", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 589.2, "to": 592.53, "sid": 270, "location": 2, "content": "而且我们的手臂也会因为高度不合适", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 592.53, "to": 593.67, "sid": 271, "location": 2, "content": "而变得僵硬", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 593.67, "to": 596.16, "sid": 272, "location": 2, "content": "不管对于瞄准还是健康都没有好处", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 596.16, "to": 597.92, "sid": 273, "location": 2, "content": "而如果我们的桌子低了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 597.92, "to": 600.02, "sid": 274, "location": 2, "content": "我们整个人就会像浮起来一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 600.02, "to": 601.58, "sid": 275, "location": 2, "content": "需要弯腰驼背", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 601.58, "to": 603.62, "sid": 276, "location": 2, "content": "才能把手放在桌子上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 603.62, "to": 606.38, "sid": 277, "location": 2, "content": "这对我们的后背和腰是有很大损伤的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 606.38, "to": 607.64, "sid": 278, "location": 2, "content": "所以相比于鼠标垫", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 607.64, "to": 609.819, "sid": 279, "location": 2, "content": "鼠标灵敏度这些无关紧要的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 609.819, "to": 613.569, "sid": 280, "location": 2, "content": "我觉得一个合适的桌椅相对高度差才是重要的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 613.569, "to": 616.06, "sid": 281, "location": 2, "content": "还有就是显示器距离这个东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 616.06, "to": 618.94, "sid": 282, "location": 2, "content": "我认为显示器距离这个东西其实因人而异", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 618.94, "to": 619.96, "sid": 283, "location": 2, "content": "只要你的显示器距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 619.96, "to": 622.6, "sid": 284, "location": 2, "content": "能让你的眼睛聚焦到目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 622.6, "to": 623.5, "sid": 285, "location": 2, "content": "那就可以了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 623.5, "to": 626.95, "sid": 286, "location": 2, "content": "近远的话其实并没有太大的关系", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 626.95, "to": 629.56, "sid": 287, "location": 2, "content": "可能离远了会对视力有一定的保护", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 629.56, "to": 632.1, "sid": 288, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢这其实就是瞄准的第二部分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 632.1, "to": 634.14, "sid": 289, "location": 2, "content": "也就是我觉得最重要的发力方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 634.14, "to": 635.4, "sid": 290, "location": 2, "content": "然后再说到瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 635.4, "to": 638.22, "sid": 291, "location": 2, "content": "最后一步其实就是确认什么是确认的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 638.22, "to": 642.18, "sid": 292, "location": 2, "content": "就是当我们用眼睛看到准星在目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 642.18, "to": 643.44, "sid": 293, "location": 2, "content": "或者用屏幕中心感", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 643.44, "to": 645.42, "sid": 294, "location": 2, "content": "感觉到准星放到目标上的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 645.42, "to": 646.72, "sid": 295, "location": 2, "content": "再进行开箱", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 646.72, "to": 648.97, "sid": 296, "location": 2, "content": "很多新手玩家呢在进行瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 648.97, "to": 650.59, "sid": 297, "location": 2, "content": "实战或者训练的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 650.59, "to": 653.24, "sid": 298, "location": 2, "content": "可能都是像这种甩枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 653.24, "to": 654.86, "sid": 299, "location": 2, "content": "他并没有确认这一步", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 654.86, "to": 656.57, "sid": 300, "location": 2, "content": "导致他的瞄准很不稳定", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 656.57, "to": 658.49, "sid": 301, "location": 2, "content": "即便打中了也感觉很魔幻", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 658.49, "to": 659.36, "sid": 302, "location": 2, "content": "就像运气一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 659.36, "to": 662.33, "sid": 303, "location": 2, "content": "所以不管是新手还是高手", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 662.33, "to": 664.49, "sid": 304, "location": 2, "content": "在瞄准的过程中一定不要跳步", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 664.49, "to": 666.02, "sid": 305, "location": 2, "content": "一定要确认这一步", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 666.02, "to": 668.94, "sid": 306, "location": 2, "content": "而这也引出了大家在瞄准的过程中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 668.94, "to": 670.92, "sid": 307, "location": 2, "content": "一定不要用超过自己眼睛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 670.92, "to": 672.86, "sid": 308, "location": 2, "content": "能看清准星的速度去瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 672.86, "to": 675.08, "sid": 309, "location": 2, "content": "比如说我以这种速度去移动我的准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 675.08, "to": 677.27, "sid": 310, "location": 2, "content": "那么相信大家都能看清楚准星的运动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 677.27, "to": 678.8, "sid": 311, "location": 2, "content": "且是否放在目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 678.8, "to": 680.87, "sid": 312, "location": 2, "content": "而如果我以这种速度去驱动准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 680.87, "to": 683.88, "sid": 313, "location": 2, "content": "那我相信大家包括我自己都看不清楚准星在哪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 683.88, "to": 685.56, "sid": 314, "location": 2, "content": "那么自然也就没法确认", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 685.56, "to": 687.69, "sid": 315, "location": 2, "content": "也就不能产生一个稳定的瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 687.69, "to": 690.81, "sid": 316, "location": 2, "content": "所以大家一定要用合理的速度去瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 690.81, "to": 694.51, "sid": 317, "location": 2, "content": "不要不要看到人就开始甩起来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 694.51, "to": 696.04, "sid": 318, "location": 2, "content": "这样的枪法是没有意义的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 696.04, "to": 697.51, "sid": 319, "location": 2, "content": "哪怕我瞄准慢了一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 697.51, "to": 699.86, "sid": 320, "location": 2, "content": "但是我确保我开枪就能打到他", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 699.86, "to": 701.39, "sid": 321, "location": 2, "content": "反而效率会很高", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 701.39, "to": 704.97, "sid": 322, "location": 2, "content": "且对以后的瞄准提升是很有帮助的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 704.97, "to": 705.78, "sid": 323, "location": 2, "content": "大家一定要记住", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 705.78, "to": 707.82, "sid": 324, "location": 2, "content": "就是先准再快", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 707.82, "to": 708.86, "sid": 325, "location": 2, "content": "准就是快", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 708.86, "to": 710.3, "sid": 326, "location": 2, "content": "不要一味的图快", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 710.3, "to": 712.46, "sid": 327, "location": 2, "content": "这就是瞄准的确认步骤", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 712.46, "to": 714.56, "sid": 328, "location": 2, "content": "那我们整个把瞄准的过程串起来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 714.56, "to": 715.25, "sid": 329, "location": 2, "content": "就是什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 715.25, "to": 716.78, "sid": 330, "location": 2, "content": "在我们走路的过程中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 716.78, "to": 719.51, "sid": 331, "location": 2, "content": "我们的眼睛聚焦的是准星附近的区域", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 719.51, "to": 720.89, "sid": 332, "location": 2, "content": "当我们看到目标时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 720.89, "to": 723.92, "sid": 333, "location": 2, "content": "我们把目光快速的聚焦到目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 723.92, "to": 726.11, "sid": 334, "location": 2, "content": "且大脑给手下达一个指令", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 726.11, "to": 728.09, "sid": 335, "location": 2, "content": "让我们我们移动我们的手", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 728.09, "to": 729.59, "sid": 336, "location": 2, "content": "带动我们的胳膊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 729.59, "to": 731.81, "sid": 337, "location": 2, "content": "把准星自然的放到目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 731.81, "to": 734.57, "sid": 338, "location": 2, "content": "这时候我们用屏幕中心感或者眼睛确认准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 734.57, "to": 735.2, "sid": 339, "location": 2, "content": "瞄到了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 735.2, "to": 736.48, "sid": 340, "location": 2, "content": "再按下左键", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 736.48, "to": 738.71, "sid": 341, "location": 2, "content": "这就是瞄准的一个完整过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 738.71, "to": 741.53, "sid": 342, "location": 2, "content": "而高手的瞄准为什么看起来简洁高效", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 741.53, "to": 743.75, "sid": 343, "location": 2, "content": "是因为他们的眼睛属性很好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 743.75, "to": 747.17, "sid": 344, "location": 2, "content": "能快速的从准星附近转移到目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 747.17, "to": 748.58, "sid": 345, "location": 2, "content": "且他们看得很清楚", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 748.58, "to": 750.62, "sid": 346, "location": 2, "content": "也就是说能看见这个小头", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 750.62, "to": 754.55, "sid": 347, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢在手快速自然的提到这个目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 754.55, "to": 756.46, "sid": 348, "location": 2, "content": "也就是手部控制能力很强", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 756.46, "to": 759.64, "sid": 349, "location": 2, "content": "而且他们会用屏幕中心感来确认是否准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 759.64, "to": 760.3, "sid": 350, "location": 2, "content": "瞄到了目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 760.3, "to": 761.47, "sid": 351, "location": 2, "content": "并不会用眼睛去看", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 761.47, "to": 762.7, "sid": 352, "location": 2, "content": "只是一种感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 762.7, "to": 765.55, "sid": 353, "location": 2, "content": "感觉瞄到就开枪了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 772.18, "to": 775.27, "sid": 354, "location": 2, "content": "所以这就是高手瞄准看起来简洁高效的原因", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 775.27, "to": 777.79, "sid": 355, "location": 2, "content": "也是瞄准的一个正确认识", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 777.79, "to": 779.47, "sid": 356, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢说完了瞄准呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 779.47, "to": 782.17, "sid": 357, "location": 2, "content": "我再说一些题外的因素呃", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 782.17, "to": 783.52, "sid": 358, "location": 2, "content": "比如说练枪软件", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 783.52, "to": 785.84, "sid": 359, "location": 2, "content": "我觉得练枪软件这个东西呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 785.84, "to": 790.04, "sid": 360, "location": 2, "content": "他首先是一个专项提高某些某项能力的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 790.04, "to": 792.11, "sid": 361, "location": 2, "content": "但你还是一个瞄准新手的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 792.11, "to": 794.97, "sid": 362, "location": 2, "content": "其实我是不建议大家盲目的使用练枪软件的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 794.97, "to": 797.88, "sid": 363, "location": 2, "content": "可能你练下你的分数能打的高", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 797.88, "to": 801.07, "sid": 364, "location": 2, "content": "但是因为你不知道正确的瞄准方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 801.07, "to": 802.24, "sid": 365, "location": 2, "content": "比如说用眼习惯啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 802.24, "to": 803.17, "sid": 366, "location": 2, "content": "发力方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 803.17, "to": 805.15, "sid": 367, "location": 2, "content": "你的练枪软件的分数", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 805.15, "to": 807.19, "sid": 368, "location": 2, "content": "是没法转换到实战当中去的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 807.19, "to": 809.47, "sid": 369, "location": 2, "content": "你只有建立了一个正确的认识", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 809.47, "to": 811.05, "sid": 370, "location": 2, "content": "再根据自己的不足", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 811.05, "to": 814.38, "sid": 371, "location": 2, "content": "比如说是垂直方向控制能力差呀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 814.38, "to": 815.88, "sid": 372, "location": 2, "content": "还是说微调速度慢啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 815.88, "to": 817.74, "sid": 373, "location": 2, "content": "还是拉枪和微调的衔接差呀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 817.74, "to": 819.12, "sid": 374, "location": 2, "content": "还是眼睛不行", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 819.12, "to": 820.45, "sid": 375, "location": 2, "content": "聚焦不到目标上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 820.45, "to": 821.95, "sid": 376, "location": 2, "content": "找到自己的薄弱点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 821.95, "to": 824.38, "sid": 377, "location": 2, "content": "再针对的去用练枪软件进行训练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 824.38, "to": 826.27, "sid": 378, "location": 2, "content": "这才是正确的练枪方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 826.27, "to": 829.16, "sid": 379, "location": 2, "content": "而且我认为练枪软件的分数嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 829.16, "to": 830.48, "sid": 380, "location": 2, "content": "大家也不用过于执着", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 830.48, "to": 832.07, "sid": 381, "location": 2, "content": "不要当练枪的魔怔人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 832.07, "to": 833.3, "sid": 382, "location": 2, "content": "我认为一些项目", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 833.3, "to": 835.83, "sid": 383, "location": 2, "content": "比如说六目标在达到12万的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 835.83, "to": 840.11, "sid": 384, "location": 2, "content": "就已经完全能在超凡局进行一个正常的对象", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 840.11, "to": 841.16, "sid": 385, "location": 2, "content": "并不用答", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 841.16, "to": 842.54, "sid": 386, "location": 2, "content": "非要练到什么13万", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 842.54, "to": 842.9, "sid": 387, "location": 2, "content": "14万", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 842.9, "to": 843.26, "sid": 388, "location": 2, "content": "15万", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 843.26, "to": 844.23, "sid": 389, "location": 2, "content": "追求一个极限", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 844.23, "to": 845.73, "sid": 390, "location": 2, "content": "当然如果你想追求世界纪录", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 845.73, "to": 846.57, "sid": 391, "location": 2, "content": "那固然可以", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 846.57, "to": 848.43, "sid": 392, "location": 2, "content": "但如果你只是用练枪软件", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 848.43, "to": 850.23, "sid": 393, "location": 2, "content": "只是想为你玩的游戏服务", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 850.23, "to": 853.82, "sid": 394, "location": 2, "content": "那没有完全没有必要当一个练枪软件的魔怔人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 853.82, "to": 857.27, "sid": 395, "location": 2, "content": "因为练枪软件在突破某些分数的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 857.27, "to": 859.76, "sid": 396, "location": 2, "content": "是需要专项的发力方式的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 859.76, "to": 860.72, "sid": 397, "location": 2, "content": "比如说green shot", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 860.72, "to": 863.96, "sid": 398, "location": 2, "content": "我要这样用手腕去进行整个的一个调整", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 863.96, "to": 868.04, "sid": 399, "location": 2, "content": "而six shot我要用一些特定的方式去进行瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 868.04, "to": 868.7, "sid": 400, "location": 2, "content": "才能打得更高", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 868.7, "to": 870.91, "sid": 401, "location": 2, "content": "这对实战其实是没有什么帮助的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 870.91, "to": 871.99, "sid": 402, "location": 2, "content": "另外呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 871.99, "to": 875.14, "sid": 403, "location": 2, "content": "这个瓦罗兰特这款游戏是个5V5竞技游戏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 875.14, "to": 877.57, "sid": 404, "location": 2, "content": "它并不是点小球射击游戏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 877.57, "to": 881.27, "sid": 405, "location": 2, "content": "有很多别的东西对于实战的影响", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 881.27, "to": 882.77, "sid": 406, "location": 2, "content": "并不比你的瞄准能力差", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 882.77, "to": 884.33, "sid": 407, "location": 2, "content": "比如说你准星的摆放", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 884.33, "to": 885.45, "sid": 408, "location": 2, "content": "你的选位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 885.45, "to": 887.1, "sid": 409, "location": 2, "content": "你当你技能的运用", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 887.1, "to": 889.86, "sid": 410, "location": 2, "content": "比如说对面站一个上下双架", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 889.86, "to": 891.51, "sid": 411, "location": 2, "content": "你就算瞄准速度再快", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 891.51, "to": 893.84, "sid": 412, "location": 2, "content": "你也不可能把两个人打在", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 893.84, "to": 895.46, "sid": 413, "location": 2, "content": "你不会控制身位的情况下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 895.46, "to": 898.31, "sid": 414, "location": 2, "content": "或者说你选一个马路中间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 898.31, "to": 900.02, "sid": 415, "location": 2, "content": "必须必定会吃闪的位置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 900.02, "to": 901.16, "sid": 416, "location": 2, "content": "就算你瞄准再快", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 901.16, "to": 901.94, "sid": 417, "location": 2, "content": "你也会吃闪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 901.94, "to": 902.93, "sid": 418, "location": 2, "content": "你也会开不出枪来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 902.93, "to": 905.41, "sid": 419, "location": 2, "content": "或者说你的移动方式有问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 905.41, "to": 906.31, "sid": 420, "location": 2, "content": "你打练枪软件的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 906.31, "to": 908.29, "sid": 421, "location": 2, "content": "你可以这个很冷静的点这些球", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 908.29, "to": 910.88, "sid": 422, "location": 2, "content": "你打实战就开始这样蹲下泼水了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 910.88, "to": 914.62, "sid": 423, "locat